  "body": "Makes the repo root scannable: it now holds only the documents an implementer works through directly.\n\n## Root now contains\n- `Mantle_PRIMER.md`\n- `Mantle_Part1_Body.md` / `Mantle_Part1_Body_Audit.md`\n- `Mantle_Part2_Mind.md` / `Mantle_Part2_Mind_Audit.md`\n- `Mantle_Assimilator.md` (Path B, pairs with Part 1)\n- Standard repo files: `README.md`, `LICENSE`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `pyproject.toml`\n\n## Moved into docs/ (alongside existing concept notes)\n- `Mantle_Doctrine.md`\n- `Mantle_Organism_Lens.md`\n- `Mantle_Organ_Atlas.md`\n- `Mantle_Extensions.md`\n- `Mantle_Positioning.md`\n\n## Reference updates\n- Root + `examples/` files now point to `docs/<name>`\n- Moved docs reference root build docs via `../<name>`\n- Moved docs reference sibling `docs/` notes by bare filename\n- Rewrote the reading-order trees in README and PRIMER; removed the stale duplicate doctrine line from the earlier `doctrine/`\u2192`docs/` merge\n\nCI is unaffected (only runs `examples/vcw/`). Stage-1 audit re-verified locally.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01A7Ey1MaGtWrix2DhdXxX4i)_",
